{"id":"da","lemma":"да","pos":"intj","rank":14,"glosses":["yes (used to confirm that the person being addressed is listening)","right, isn't it (used at the end of an affirmative sentence, turning what was said into a question, asking for confirmation)","really (used to express surprise or ask for confirmation)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6c/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Да, я знаю.","en":"Yes, I know.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/42475","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"Ты сказал «да»?","en":"Did you say yes?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},null]},{"text":"Вы сказали да?","en":"Did you say yes?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},null]},{"text":"Это да или нет?","en":"Is it a yes or a no?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"or"},{"g":"no / there isn't"}]},{"text":"Просто скажите да.","en":"Just say yes.","words":[{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},null]}]}